sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Verifier as Employer / Third Party
    participant UI as Verification Portal
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Hash as Hashing Service
    participant Contract as Smart Contract (Solidity)
    participant DB as Relational DB (Public Info)

    Verifier->>UI: Upload PDF Degree or Enter Cert ID
    UI->>API: POST /api/verify (file multipart or cert_id)
    opt PDF Document Uploaded
        API->>Hash: Compute SHA-256 Digest of Uploaded File
        Hash-->>API: Return calculated_hash
    end
    API->>Contract: verifyCertificate(certId, calculated_hash)
    Contract-->>API: Returns (exists, hashMatches, revoked, issuer, issuedAt)
    alt Certificate Does Not Exist
        API-->>UI: Verdict: NOT_FOUND (No blockchain record)
    else Hash Mismatch (hashMatches == false)
        API-->>UI: Verdict: INVALID / MODIFIED (Cryptographic Tampering Detected)
    else Revoked (revoked == true)
        API-->>UI: Verdict: REVOKED (Previously issued but revoked by university)
    else Valid & Active
        API->>DB: Query institution public name & degree
        DB-->>API: Metadata
        API-->>UI: Verdict: VALID (Authenticity Cryptographically Proven)
    end
    UI-->>Verifier: Render Big Visual Status Card & Blockchain Proof
